        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Capra, Ken Mora\n- Roles: film director, producer, writer, screenplay writer, editor, voice actor\n- Topics: American film careers, Italian-American identity\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Capra was born as Francesco Rosario Capra on May 18, 1897, and he died on September 3, 1991.\n- Frank Capra was an Italian-American film director, producer, and writer.\n- Frank Capra became the creative force behind some major award-winning films of the 1930s and 1940s.\n- Ken Mora was born on December 17, 1960.\n- Ken Mora is an American screenplay writer, director, producer, editor, and voice actor.",
